@page "/sitesummary/{siteid:int}"

<h3>Site Status Summary</h3>

This is the landing page. It opens by defailt and gives an overview of the site status. Site ID is @siteId

If the user is a Customer Administrator then the last site visited is saved and the menu, and this page, will open the next time the user logs in.

@code {

    [Parameter]
    public int siteId { get; set; }



}
